    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It’s almost tempting. The idea that I don't have to carry this anymore. But if I just sit here and wait for the ashes to cover me, it feels like I'm just lingering. Like I'm a ghost that hasn't realized it's dead yet. It feels wrong to just exist in this nothingness.",
